1
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:22,000
[Zhijiang Capacity Infinite Tech (Zhejiang) Co., Ltd. & Zhejiang Yanhe Culture Tech Co., Ltd.]

2
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:04,000
Lord Su.

3
00:01:04,319 --> 00:01:06,250
The limb joints of the two deceased

4
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:07,600
were broken off alive.

5
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:10,160
There are scratch marks from the fingers on the inside of the clay pot.

6
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:13,080
This means that when the victims were put into the pots,

7
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:14,340
they were not yet dead.

8
00:01:15,680 --> 00:01:17,680
There are abrasions on the fingers.

9
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:19,320
They should be caused by struggling.

10
00:01:19,320 --> 00:01:20,680
Breaking the joints.

11
00:01:21,520 --> 00:01:22,850
From this point of view,

12
00:01:23,240 --> 00:01:25,800
either the killer is born with supernatural strength,

13
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:28,800
or it really is a rat demon causing trouble.

14
00:01:29,520 --> 00:01:30,160
It seems

15
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:32,520
that it's indeed somewhat different

16
00:01:32,520 --> 00:01:34,650
from the method of making human swine.

17
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:36,720
Is the yellow soup in the urn

18
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:38,960
the same as the one in the clay pot last time?

19
00:01:38,960 --> 00:01:39,720
Yes.

20
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:45,080
This pattern is indeed the same as last time.

21
00:01:45,080 --> 00:01:47,009
It seems to be a serial murder case.

22
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:52,440
You just said there was another medicinal herb.

23
00:01:52,440 --> 00:01:53,880
It's only found in Yeren Valley.

24
00:01:53,880 --> 00:01:54,320
Yes.

25
00:01:54,600 --> 00:01:56,160
It's called Jiangbian Yiwan Shui.

26
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:57,440
What about the other herbs?

27
00:01:57,440 --> 00:01:59,240
They can all be bought in the city.

28
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:00,600
Check all the pharmacies in the city.

29
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:01,130
Let's go.

30
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:14,520
Baohetang Pharmacy.

31
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:17,410
In the past few days,

32
00:02:17,440 --> 00:02:18,400
has your shop encountered

33
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:21,000
any suspicious strangers coming to buy herbs?

34
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:23,160
People who come here for herbs

35
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:24,690
are either sick themselves

36
00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:26,600
or have a sick family member.

37
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:28,720
So they all look a bit strange.

38
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:29,840
Officer Su,

39
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:31,840
what kind of strange do you mean?

40
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:34,880
Stranger than the usual customers.

41
00:02:35,160 --> 00:02:38,560
Like abnormal clothing or behavior.

42
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,420
I really can't remember clearly.

43
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:45,320
Forgive me.

44
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:52,440
This is the last pharmacy.

45
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:54,250
We don't have a single clue.

46
00:02:54,320 --> 00:02:55,560
Wrong method.

47
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:56,720
Wasted effort.

48
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:57,770
What do you mean?

49
00:02:57,880 --> 00:02:59,160
Memory Recovery Technique.

50
00:02:59,160 --> 00:02:59,890
How about it?

51
00:03:00,320 --> 00:03:02,050
Have you remembered anything?

52
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:07,040
I actually do remember something.

53
00:03:07,040 --> 00:03:08,120
Three days ago,

54
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:11,440
there really was a strange customer who came for herbs.

55
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:12,440
That person

56
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:14,560
was tightly wrapped all over,

57
00:03:14,880 --> 00:03:16,340
wearing a long black robe,

58
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:18,440
head covered in a hood,

59
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:20,600
and wearing a black veil.

60
00:03:20,880 --> 00:03:21,600
Age,

61
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:22,320
appearance,

62
00:03:22,320 --> 00:03:22,880
build?

63
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:24,600
Appearance,

64
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:26,320
height...

65
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:29,000
I couldn't really tell his age with the veil.

66
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:30,440
Also, the way he walked

67
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:31,840
was swaying.

68
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:34,560
It looked like there was something wrong with his legs.

69
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:35,720
What herbs did he buy?

70
00:03:35,720 --> 00:03:36,320
Herbs?

71
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:41,440
There were too many.

72
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,000
And,

73
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:44,600
they were all tonics.

74
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:51,840
Your memory recovery method is really impressive.

75
00:03:51,880 --> 00:03:52,600
I think

76
00:03:52,880 --> 00:03:55,000
he will definitely come again in the next few days.

77
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:56,440
We just need to wait.

78
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:59,600
Maybe he'll go to another shop.

79
00:03:59,880 --> 00:04:02,160
This isn't the only pharmacy in the city.

80
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:05,160
I'm sure he will only come to this one.

81
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:16,760
[Outside Baohetang Pharmacy]

82
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:18,000
Here he is.

83
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:30,960
What do you think?

84
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:32,520
Am I brilliant?

85
00:04:33,520 --> 00:04:35,050
How on earth did you do that?

86
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:37,730
It was nothing, really.

87
00:04:37,880 --> 00:04:38,960
I simply

88
00:04:38,960 --> 00:04:40,960
bought all the medicinal herbs from pharmacies

89
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:42,080
within 10 miles.

90
00:04:42,280 --> 00:04:44,280
This is the only place that has them.

91
00:04:44,280 --> 00:04:45,520
You can do that?

92
00:04:45,960 --> 00:04:46,520
Wow.

93
00:04:46,520 --> 00:04:48,040
How much did that cost?

94
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:48,840
My way of doing things

95
00:04:48,840 --> 00:04:50,760
is simple and direct.

96
00:04:52,280 --> 00:04:54,880
I actually kind of admire you right now,

97
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:57,610
Shen Zhao, for squandering money for the people.

98
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:11,640
Follow him.

99
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:12,170
Let's go.

100
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:19,240
[Ruined temple]

101
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:50,200
It must be him.

102
00:06:07,960 --> 00:06:08,760
Damn it.

103
00:06:08,960 --> 00:06:09,960
He got away again.

104
00:06:13,280 --> 00:06:13,960
Watch out.

105
00:07:00,960 --> 00:07:01,890
Don't chase him.

106
00:07:02,400 --> 00:07:03,460
We can't catch him.

107
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:19,080
I saw his true face.

108
00:07:19,840 --> 00:07:20,520
What did he look like?

109
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:21,960
He had a rat head with sharp teeth,

110
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:23,080
terrifying prickly whiskers,

111
00:07:23,080 --> 00:07:24,520
and looked absolutely horrifying.

112
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:25,960
He can change his shape

113
00:07:26,400 --> 00:07:28,200
and possesses monstrous strength.

114
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:29,400
Could there really be

115
00:07:29,840 --> 00:07:30,960
a rat spirit?

116
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,040
I doubt it.

117
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:33,840
Among street performers,

118
00:07:33,840 --> 00:07:36,640
there's a martial art called the bone-shrinking skill.

119
00:07:36,640 --> 00:07:38,159
It allows one to alter their bone positions at will

120
00:07:38,159 --> 00:07:39,360
to shrink their body.

121
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:40,700
I think this rat spirit

122
00:07:40,960 --> 00:07:43,820
is just a dwarf who knows the bone-shrinking skill.

123
00:07:43,960 --> 00:07:46,640
He usually walks on stilts to deceive people.

124
00:07:47,880 --> 00:07:48,400
Yes.

125
00:07:49,520 --> 00:07:50,080
This...

126
00:08:12,400 --> 00:08:13,160
Look at this.

127
00:08:17,400 --> 00:08:18,400
This jade pendant

128
00:08:18,520 --> 00:08:19,580
is smooth and warm.

129
00:08:19,960 --> 00:08:21,400
It must be very expensive.

130
00:08:21,400 --> 00:08:22,080
Moreover,

131
00:08:22,520 --> 00:08:24,650
it has the character 'Xu' carved on it.

132
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:27,200
It must be their family name.

133
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:29,800
We can follow this clue to keep looking.

134
00:08:32,880 --> 00:08:36,000
These are all the files of the wealthy families in Fangzhou.

135
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,640
I can't find the Xu family at all.

136
00:08:37,640 --> 00:08:40,280
Maybe the Xu family is not from Fangzhou.

137
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:44,480
We can write to the Ministry of Revenue in Chang'an

138
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,520
and ask them to pull up

139
00:08:45,520 --> 00:08:47,640
the household registers of all wealthy Xu families

140
00:08:47,640 --> 00:08:48,760
to see if there are any clues.

141
00:08:48,760 --> 00:08:50,690
Send it to the Ministry of Revenue?

142
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:53,130
Following normal procedures,

143
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:56,120
sending a letter from Fangzhou to Chang'an

144
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,480
and waiting for a reply

145
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:58,760
will take at least half a month.

146
00:08:58,760 --> 00:09:00,220
It might take even longer.

147
00:09:00,880 --> 00:09:01,880
By the time we get the news,

148
00:09:01,880 --> 00:09:03,880
the murderer will have run far away.

149
00:09:04,760 --> 00:09:05,640
Don't forget,

150
00:09:05,880 --> 00:09:06,760
you have me.

151
00:09:08,400 --> 00:09:09,660
It's so good to be rich.

152
00:09:21,640 --> 00:09:23,300
Use the expedited relay post.

153
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:24,640
Deliver this letter and token

154
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:27,280
to Lord Li of the Ministry of Revenue in Chang'an.

155
00:09:27,280 --> 00:09:28,880
Money alone

156
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:30,520
can't do this.

157
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:31,960
Remember,

158
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:33,520
don't reveal my identity.

159
00:09:33,520 --> 00:09:34,880
Yes, Nephew.

160
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:38,660
Forgive me, Lord Ling.

161
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:39,890
I will take my leave.

162
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:41,000
Go quickly.

163
00:10:11,640 --> 00:10:13,640
Help me! Help me!

164
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:14,760
A rat demon!

165
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:15,880
A big rat demon!

166
00:10:15,880 --> 00:10:17,640
The rat demon is going to kill me!
